\ A mutual tail-recursive cycle through an `if` arm, pinned interpreted. Every edge is a tail
\ call, so the interpreter runs two million iterations in constant native stack. Running flat is
\ the target every tier converges on.
\
\ The eager twin is eager_tail_boundary_mutual_cycle.1z. No hybrid twin exists, because under
\ `--compile=hybrid` the two words compile, call each other natively below any stack guard, and
\ the process dies on a signal the harness cannot pin.

pong: ( n -- ) [ 1 - ping ] ;
ping: ( n -- ) [ dup 0 > [ pong ] [ drop "done" print-line ] if ] ;

[ 2000000 ping ] [ error-type: @get . wipe ] recover
